{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"21":"Funerals (Kitab Al-Jana'iz)"},"section_detail":{"21":{"hadithnumber_first":3089,"hadithnumber_last":3241,"arabicnumber_first":3089,"arabicnumber_last":3241,"name_native":"كتاب الجنائز"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3144,"arabicnumber":3144,"text":"حدثنا محمد بن المثنى، حدثنا عبد الاعلى، حدثنا هشام، عن حفصة بنت سيرين، عن ام عطية، قالت وضفرنا راسها ثلاثة قرون ثم القيناها خلفها مقدم راسها وقرنيها","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari (1263) Sahih Muslim (939)"}],"reference":{"book":21,"hadith":56}}]}